  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "まちなかで　くらすことを　このむ。はねの　いろで　グループを　つくりなわばりあらそいを　くりひろげる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "마을에서 사는 것을 선호한다. 깃털 색에 따라 그룹을 만들고는 영역 다툼을 벌인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜歡棲息在街上。會以羽毛的顏色組隊，展開爭奪地盤之戰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ces Pokémon préfèrent vivre en ville. Ils forment des groupes selon la couleur de leur plumage et se livrent à des luttes de territoire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese Pokémon leben bevorzugt in Städten. Sie bilden nach Gefiederfarbe sortierte Gruppen und tragen untereinander Revierkämpfe aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prefieren vivir en las ciudades. Forman bandadas según el color de su plumaje y libran disputas por el control de los territorios.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Preferiscono vivere in centri abitati. Formano stormi in base al colore del piumaggio e lottano per espandere il loro dominio sul territorio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These Pokémon prefer to live in cities. They form flocks based on the color of their feathers, and they fight over territory.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "街中で　暮らすことを　好む。羽の　色で　グループを　作り縄張り争いを　繰り広げる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜欢栖息在街道上。会以羽毛的颜色来组队，然后展开领地之争。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prefieren vivir en las ciudades. Forman bandadas según el color de su plumaje y libran disputas por el control de los territorios.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みどりいろの　はねの　イキリンコが！\u0004\t最大勢力さいだいせいりょく最大勢力。　エサを　さがすあさと　ばんは　とても　さわがしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "녹색 깃털의 시비꼬가 가장 세력이 크다. 먹이를 찾는 아침과 밤에는 매우 시끄럽다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "綠色羽毛的怒鸚哥勢力最為龐大。在覓食時段的早晨和夜晚會非常吵鬧。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ceux qui arborent un plumage vert ont le plus d’influence. Ils font un véritable vacarme le matin et le soir, quand ils cherchent de la nourriture.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Krawalloro mit grünem Gefieder haben den größten Einfluss. Die Futtersuche am Morgen und Abend ist mit sehr viel Lärm verbunden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los Squawkabilly de plumas verdes son los predominantes. Arman mucho ruido al buscar comida por las mañanas y las noches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gli Squawkabilly dal piumaggio verde sono i più potenti. Quando vanno alla ricerca di cibo, di mattina e di sera, fanno sempre molto baccano.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Green-feathered flocks hold the most sway. When they’re out searching for food in the mornings and evenings, it gets very noisy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "緑色の　羽の　イキリンコが！\u0004\t最大勢力さいだいせいりょく最大勢力。　エサを　探す朝と　晩は　とても　騒がしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有绿色羽毛的怒鹦哥势力最为庞大。在觅食时段的早晨和夜晚会非常吵。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los Squawkabilly de plumas verdes son los predominantes. Arman mucho ruido al buscar comida por las mañanas y las noches.",
      "language": {
